⍝ ==== s2 driver: s2c file.trh [-o out] [--tokens | --ast | --check | --emit-llvm] [--debug]
⍝ The dumps print what trithc prints; without one, the program is compiled as trithc does.

⎔ $trith_write_file$ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹wfile› ⸫
⎔ $system$ ⟨⟗ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹system› ⸫

⍝ ‹streq2› a b: the strings are equal
⦃
  ⧖:a,b
  ⧗:a,b ○ ⦶
  ⍝ the loop carries [a b i acc]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,b,i,acc
    ⧗:a,i ᛒ ⧖:x
    ⧗:a,b ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:acc ⧗:x ⧗:b,i ᛒ ᛖ ⋎
    ⧗:x #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:a,b,i,acc ⧗:acc
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹streq2› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:a,b ⧗:b ⟗ ⧗:a ‹streq2› ⧖:r ⌁̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹streqo› ⸫

⍝ ‹modeof› arg: 1 for --tokens, 2 for --ast, 3 for --check, 4 for --emit-llvm, 6 for -o,
⍝ 15 for --debug (compile with -O0), else 0
⦃
  ⟗ $--tokens$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r1 ⟗ $--ast$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r2 ⟗ $--check$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r3 ⟗ $--emit-llvm$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r4
  ⟗ $-o$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r6 ⟗ $--debug$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r15 ⌁̵
  ○ ⧗:r15 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #15# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r6 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #6# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r4 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #4# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r3 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r2 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r1 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹modeof› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,out,count,rem
  ⧗:path ⎙̵ $: error: imbalance: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:count ᛁ $ tokens, $ ⎙̵ ⧗:rem ᛁ $ too many for the Ternary Balance Law\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:out ⌁̵ △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹imbal› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:T,st ⧗:st ⟗ ⧗:T ‹adump› ⌁̵ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹dumpw› ⸫

⍝ ‹astw› path toks: parse, tangle and print the item tree
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks
  ⧗:toks ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:path ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:st ‹dumpw› ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹astw› ⸫

⍝ ‹checkw› path toks: parse, tangle and check (printing the trace), then "ok"
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks
  ⧗:toks ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:path ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:path,st △ ‹cinit› ‹check› ⌁̵ $ok\n$ ⎙̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹checkw› ⸫

⍝ ‹emitw› path toks debug: parse, tangle, check and print the LLVM IR
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks,dbg
  ⧗:toks ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:path ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:path,st ○ ‹cinit› ‹check› ⧗:dbg ‹egen› ⌁̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹emitw› ⸫

⍝ ‹compilew› path toks mode: compile to an executable, as trithc does (5: next to the source, 6: -o)
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks,mode
  ⧗:mode #10# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:dbg
  ⧗:toks ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:path ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:path,st ○ ‹cinit› ‹check› ⧗:dbg ‹eir› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C,q,mode,dbg ‹ebuild› ⌁̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹compilew› ⸫

⍝ ‹eheapstr› cps C: code points (after a sentinel) as a heap string
⦃
  ⧖:pc,C
  ⧗:C ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:pc,C,e ○ ⧗:pc ᚴ
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n
    ⧗:pc,C,e,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n ⧗:pc ⧗:C,e ⧗:pc,j ᚳ ‹scp› ⧗:e ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:e ⧖:C ⌁̱ ⧗:C,e
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eheapstr› ⸫
⍝ ‹eoutname› C mode: the output path: argument 3 after -o, else the source without .trh (or .ŧ)
⦃
  ⧖:C,mode
  ⧗:mode ⧗:mode #10# ≶ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ #10# ⊟ ⦄ ∅ ⧖:m
  ⧗:C ⧗:m #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹eoutarg› ⦄ ⦃ ‹estripext› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eoutname› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C #3# ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⟗ ᛞ ⧖:oc ⌁̵ ⧖:CC ⧗:oc ⟗ ⧗:CC ‹eheapstr› ⧖:CC2,s ⌁̵ ⧗:CC2,s ⦄ ⦃ ‹usage› #-1# ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eoutarg› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C #6# ‹reg› ⧖:C,p
  ⧗:C,p ‹slen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,p ⧗:n #4# ⊟ ‹sat› ⧖:C,dot
  ⧗:C,p ○ ⧗:n #2# ⊟ ⧗:n #4# ⊟ ⧗:dot #46# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ‹ssub›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹estripext› ⸫
⍝ ‹etextof› C s: a heap string as text
⦃ ⧖:C,s ⧗:C »« ⧗:s ‹estext› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ʃ⟩ ‹etextof› ⸫
⍝ ‹ewrite› C path q: write the lines of q to the file path (both heap strings)
⦃
  ⧖:C,path,q
  ⧗:C,q »« ‹eqtext› ⧖:C,text
  ⧗:C,path ‹etextof› ⧖:C,pt
  ⧗:pt ⟗ ⧗:text ‹wfile2› ⧖:r ⌁̵
  ⧗:C,path ⧗:r ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹spr› $: error: cannot write\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ewrite› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:p,t ⧗:t ⟗ ⧗:p ⍿¹ ‹wfile› ⧖:r ⌁̱ ⌁̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹wfile2› ⸫
⍝ ‹esys› C cmd: run a shell command (a heap string); stop if it fails
⦃
  ⧖:C,cmd
  ⧗:C,cmd ‹etextof› ⧖:C,ct
  ⧗:ct ⟗ ‹system› ⧖:r ⌁̵
  ⧗:C ⧗:r ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹esys› ⸫
⍝ ‹ebuild› C q mode dbg: write the IR (and the FFI glue), then let clang and llvm-link make the executable
⦃
  ⧖:C,q,mode,dbg
  ⧗:C,mode ‹eoutname› ⧖:C,out
  ⧗:C %%{out}.ll%% ⧖:C,ll
  ⧗:C,ll,q ‹ewrite› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ‹eglue› ⧖:C,gq
  ⧗:C ⧗:gq #2# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,ng
  ⧗:C ⧗:dbg △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ %%-O0 -g%% ⦄ ⦃ %%-O2%% ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,opt
  ⧗:C %%clang -S -emit-llvm {opt} -w -o {out}.c0.ll trith/runtime/trith_rt.c 2>&1%% ‹esys› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,out,gq,opt ⧗:ng ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ %%%% ⦄ ⦃ ‹eglueb› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,more
  ⧗:C %%llvm-link -o {out}.bc {ll} {out}.c0.ll{more} 2>&1%% ‹esys› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C %%clang {opt} -w -o {out} {out}.bc -lm 2>&1%% ‹esys›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ebuild› ⸫
⍝ the FFI glue as C: written, compiled, and named for the link
⦃
  ⧖:C,out,gq,opt
  ⧗:C %%{out}.ffi.c%% ⧖:C,gp
  ⧗:C,gp,gq ‹ewrite› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C %%clang -S -emit-llvm {opt} -w -o {out}.c1.ll {gp} 2>&1%% ‹esys› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C %% {out}.c1.ll%%
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹eglueb› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,out,mode
  ⧗:path,out,mode ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ
  ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⧗:o ⟗ ‹dump› ⌁̵ ⌁̵ ⦄
    ⦃ ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o ‹astw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄
      ⦃ ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o ‹checkw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄
        ⦃ ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⍿¹ #14# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ #14# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:d ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o,d ‹emitw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄
          ⦃ ⧖:o,m ⟗ ⧗:o,m ‹compilew› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹run› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode,out
  ⧗:out ⟗ ○ ᚳ ⧖:count ⧖:out
  ⧗:count #3# ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⍿⁰ ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ #3# ⊞ ⦄ ⧖:rem
  ⧗:path,out,count,rem,mode
  ⧗:rem ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:m ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:m ‹run› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹imbal› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹main3› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode,src
  ⧗:src ⟗ ᛞ ⧖:cps ⌁̵
  ⧗:path ⟗ ⧗:cps ‹lexw› ⧗:mode ⍿¹ ⁇ ⦃ ‹main3› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹main2› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode
  ⧗:path ⟗ ᚠ ⧗:mode ⍿¹ ⁇
    ⦃ ⟗ ⍴̱ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⌁ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
    ⦃ ⌁ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹main1› ⸫

⦃ $usage: s2c <file.trh> [-o <output>] [--tokens | --ast | --check | --emit-llvm] [--debug]\n$ ⎙̵ #2# ‹exit› ⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ‹usage› ⸫

⍝ ‹isdebug› i: argument i is --debug
⦃ ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ⟗ $--debug$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r ⌁̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹isdebug› ⸫
⍝ ‹modefix› m: a --debug after the mode (or after -o's path) adds 10, where it matters
⦃
  ⍿⁰ #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #4# ‹isdebug› ⋔ ⦃ #10# ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #3# ‹isdebug› ⋔ ⦃ #10# ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹modefix› ⸫

⦃
  △ ᚨ ⁇
    ⦃ #2# ᚨ ⁇
        ⦃ ‹modeof› ‹modefix› ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̵ ‹usage› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main1› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
        ⦃ #5# ‹main1› ⦄ ⦄
    ⦃ ‹usage› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
